    "id": 15664431104371,
    "title": "FULL-SPINE ULTRA OVERNIGHT™",
    "body_html": "<h2>Made for the nights when comfort matters most.</h2><p>FULL-SPINE ULTRA OVERNIGHT™ is a premium period underwear design in development, created around extended front-to-rear coverage and a five-layer protection concept for overnight wear.</p><h3>Design highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Proposed continuous Full-Spine coverage architecture.</li>\n<li>Contoured side protection concept for sleeping positions.</li>\n<li>Moisture-management and soft-touch fabric design goals.</li>\n<li>Reusable, washable construction under development.</li>\n</ul><p><strong>Pre-production concept:</strong> absorbency, durability, sizing, materials and performance require factory sample validation. Product is not yet offered for sale.</p>",
